config OWNTECH_SHIELD_API
	bool "Enable OwnTech Shield API"
	default y
	depends on OWNTECH_SPIN_API
	depends on HAS_POWER_SHIELD
	help
		This module provides functions to interact with Spin shields.

config OWNTECH_POWER_DUTY_SEQ_MAX_LEN
	int "Maximum number of values in a leg duty-cycle sequence"
	default 64
	range 1 1024
	depends on OWNTECH_SHIELD_API
	help
		Size of the per-leg buffers used by PowerAPI::setDutySequence().
		Each leg enabled in the device tree reserves 16 bytes per value
		(float copy, staging and two DMA copies for double buffering).
